<InteriorLayout title="Website Privacy | I.S Design + Build" description="How the I.S Design + Build website handles the information you share in a project inquiry." label="Privacy policy" headline="Your information. A clear explanation.">
  <Fragment slot="intro"><p>What this website does with the details you share.</p><p class="guide-byline">Last updated 15 November 2026</p></Fragment>
  <section class="copy-section"><p class="cg-label">Website inquiries</p><div class="copy-body"><h2>The project form</h2><p>When you send the project form, the details you enter are emailed to I.S Design + Build through our website host and an email delivery service, so we can reply. The website does not keep a copy in a database.</p><p>If the form cannot send, it prepares the same text for you to send from your own email app instead. In that case nothing leaves your device until you send the email.</p><h2>Contacting the company</h2><p>If you email or call us, the information you share is used to respond to your question and discuss your project. Please share only information needed for that inquiry. A town or ZIP code is sufficient to begin discussing coverage.</p><h2>Website hosting and external links</h2><p>This site is hosted by Vercel, which processes technical request information to deliver and protect the website. Links to Google reviews and other external services take you to sites with their own privacy practices. Your email provider also processes messages sent through your email app.</p><h2>Website analytics</h2><p>This site uses Google Tag Manager and Google Analytics to understand how visitors find and use it: which pages are viewed, which links are used (for example to call or email us), and the general location and type of device. Google processes this information and may use cookies or similar identifiers.</p><p>Our Google Analytics settings can also detect contact details typed into forms on this site, such as an email address or phone number, and send them to Google in an encoded (hashed) form to help measure inquiries. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener">how Google uses information from sites that use its services</a>.</p><h2>Questions about your information</h2><p>Contact <a href="mailto:info@isdesignandbuild.com">info@isdesignandbuild.com</a> to ask about information you have shared or request its correction or deletion.</p></div></section>
</InteriorLayout>
